      "message": "fix(app): seed a default Slot as wide as its tool\n\nReview fix of PR #3635. A Slot whose width comes from the seed takes the\nlarger of 4 mm and its tool's diameter (operation::seed_slot_for_tool),\nat the ribbon's quick-add, MCP add_operation before its params patch and\nChangeOperationKind. A tool of 4 mm or less gives the old operation. The\nslot gate leaves alone a width that only falls back from picks that seed\nno slot (operation::slot_width_is_stated); generation still names those\npicks. The ChangeTool check skips such operations too.\n\nRefs #3475\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
